    <!-- Examination and Entrance Test Queries -->
    <section id="exam-queries" class="my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">AE-FUNAI Examination and Entrance Test</h2>
      <ul class="section-txt child-ul">
        <li><strong>FUNAI Post UTME Form Release Date:</strong> The FUNAI Post UTME form is typically released shortly after the announcement of the JAMB UTME results. For the upcoming academic session, the release date will be communicated on the university’s <a href="https://funai.edu.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official website</a>. Keep checking the website regularly for updates.</li>
        
        <li><strong>FUNAI Post UTME Past Questions:</strong> You can access past Post UTME questions for FUNAI through authorized vendors or online platforms. These materials are helpful for understanding the format and style of questions. Visit the university's bookstore or inquire from the admissions office for official past question booklets.</li>
        
        <li><strong>How to Prepare for FUNAI Post UTME:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Review JAMB subjects relevant to your course.</li>
            <li>Practice past Post UTME questions under timed conditions.</li>
            <li>Focus on speed and accuracy.</li>
            <li>Stay updated on exam schedules via the <a href="https://portal.funai.edu.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FUNAI Portal</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        
        <li><strong>FUNAI Admission Requirements for Direct Entry Students:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Possess at least two A-Level passes or equivalent qualifications.</li>
            <li>Obtain a minimum of lower credit in relevant ND, NCE, or HND programs.</li>
            <li>Provide a transcript from the previous institution (if applicable).</li>
            <li>Participate in FUNAI’s direct entry screening exercise.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        
        <li><strong>FUNAI Cut-Off Marks for Post UTME:</strong> The general cut-off mark for FUNAI’s Post UTME is 150 for most programs. However, specific courses such as Medicine, Law, and Engineering may have higher cut-off marks:
          <ul>
            <li>Medicine: 250</li>
            <li>Law: 240</li>
            <li>Engineering: 200</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        
        <li><strong>Is There Any Entrance Exam for FUNAI Admission?</strong> Yes, FUNAI conducts a Post UTME screening exercise for all eligible candidates. Direct entry candidates may also undergo a separate screening process.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Accommodation and Campus Queries -->
    <section id="accommodation-queries" class="my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">Apply for Accommodation at FUNAI</h2>
      <ul class="section-txt child-ul">
        <li><strong>1. Does FUNAI Offer Hostel Accommodation for Freshmen?</strong> Yes, FUNAI provides hostel accommodation for freshmen. Spaces are allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, so early booking is essential.</li>
        
        <li><strong>2. How Much Is Hostel Accommodation at FUNAI?</strong> The cost of hostel accommodation at FUNAI ranges from ₦20,000 to ₦50,000 per academic session, depending on the type of hostel and facilities provided.</li>
        
        <li><strong>3. Campus Facilities at FUNAI for New Students:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Modern lecture halls and laboratories.</li>
            <li>A well-equipped library.</li>
            <li>Sports and recreational facilities.</li>
            <li>Cafeterias and shopping centers.</li>
            <li>Internet and IT support services.</li>
            <li>Health services through the university clinic.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        
        <li><strong>4. How to Find Housing Near FUNAI:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Contact local estate agents in the Ndufu-Alike area.</li>
            <li>Join student forums or groups for housing recommendations.</li>
            <li>Visit neighborhoods near the university to inspect available rooms or apartments.</li>
            <li>Ensure the location is safe and easily accessible.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        
        <li><strong>5. How to Book Hostel Space at FUNAI:</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Visit the <a href="https://portal.funai.edu.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FUNAI Hostel Portal</a>.</li>
            <li>Log in with your student credentials.</li>
            <li>Navigate to the accommodation section.</li>
            <li>Select your preferred hostel and complete the payment.</li>
            <li>Print the confirmation receipt for verification upon arrival.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- International Students Section -->
    <section id="international-queries" class="my-4">
